{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "50b3b20a-7034-8637-857c-3b7d8512960a",
  "created_at": "2026-03-02T13:15:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linh Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I got a parking ticket in the mail. Well, it was on my windshield first, and now there's a second NOTICE in the mail. Forty minutes I was parked. Forty! And they want me to pay it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I can look at what it says and explain the options."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:12:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the letter right here. Hold on. [pause] Okay. It says the ticket number is, um, it's a long one. You want it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not just yet. Let me first ask what you'd like to do. Are you looking to pay it, or dispute it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I want to contest it. How do I do that? And what is this hearing, what happens? Do I have to stand up in front of a ROOM of people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, you request a hearing in writing or in person by the deadline printed on the notice. A hearing officer reviews the ticket, you explain your side, and you may bring photographs or receipts. It's not a courtroom with a crowd. It's fairly informal, but it is conducted in an orderly way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Informal. Okay. And the deadline, is on the letter? I see a date but it's got a smudge on the NUMBER."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please read me the date as best you can, and I'll confirm it against the ticket record once I have your ticket number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It looks like the ninth. Or the nineteenth. Wicked small print, they make it so small. Somebody wants me to miss it, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let's get the ticket number, and I'll verify the exact date for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:05-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine, fine. Hold on, I smell something. Sorry, there's a candle burning in here, cinnamon. My neighbor gave it to me and the whole kitchen smells like CINNAMON. Where was I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The ticket number, ma'am, whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It's four, four, one, seven, eight, zero, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. One moment. [pause] I see it. The deadline to request a hearing is the nineteenth of this month."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The nineteenth. Good. Now, if I lose, can I pay it over time? Is there a payment PLAN? I'm on a fixed income, and the fine is not nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the department does offer payment arrangements in some cases. You would need to request that in person or by phone once any hearing is decided, and someone in our office would set the terms."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So hearing first, plan after. That's what I wanted to know. Honestly, forty minutes. Thank you, dear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-02T13:14:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Please keep the notice with you, and have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
